<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
    <TargetFrameworks>netstandard2.0;net8.0;net9.0;net10.0</TargetFrameworks>
    <ImplicitUsings>enable</ImplicitUsings>
    <Nullable>enable</Nullable>
    <LangVersion>latest</LangVersion>
    <GenerateDocumentationFile>true</GenerateDocumentationFile>
    <IsPackable>false</IsPackable>

    <!-- NuGet paket meta bilgileri -->
    <PackageId>VeloxMapper.Core</PackageId>
    <Version>6.0.0</Version>
    <Authors>Umut Ozer</Authors>
    <Description>VeloxMapper core abstractions, attributes, exceptions and caching primitives. High-performance, deterministic, NativeAOT-compatible object mapping library.</Description>
    <PackageTags>mapping;object-mapper;source-generator;nativeaot</PackageTags>
    <PackageLicenseExpression>MIT</PackageLicenseExpression>
    <PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/umutozer/VeloxMapper</RepositoryUrl>
    <RepositoryType>git</RepositoryType>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <None Include="..\..\README.md" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <!--
    ⚠️ MİMARİ NOT: Generator referansı burada YOKTUR.
    
    Neden: VeloxMapper.Generators projesi VeloxMapper.Core'a bağımlıdır (attribute türlerini okumak için).
           Eğer Core da Generators'a referans verirse → dairesel bağımlılık (circular dependency) oluşur.
    
    Çözüm: Generator, ANA tüketici paketi (VeloxMapper) içinden referans verilir.
    Böylece bağımlılık grafiği:
    
      VeloxMapper.Generators → VeloxMapper.Core (compile-time, PrivateAssets=all)
      VeloxMapper             → VeloxMapper.Core (runtime)
      VeloxMapper             → VeloxMapper.Generators (analyzer, ReferenceOutputAssembly=false)
    
    NuGet paketleme stratejisi:
      - VeloxMapper.Core.nupkg → Sadece abstractions, attributes, exceptions (bağımsız paket)
      - VeloxMapper.nupkg → Runtime engine + Generator embed (ana paket)
  -->

</Project>
